## Key Concepts

- Pub/Sub triggers and message ack semantics
- Cloud Functions for lightweight validation
- BigQuery streaming inserts with insertId for idempotency
- Dead-letter policy and retry behavior
- Basic end-to-end test strategy (malformed payloads, replays, success paths)

